{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:77f5d7c8596d270b9c70287ba2eab764", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 9, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "I bumped `pyproject.toml` to version `2.5.0` and ran `./publish-package.sh`, which published the package. As flagged earlier, this is a downgrade from the previously released `2.6.1`/`2.6.0`/`2.5.3` versions - please make sure downstream consumers and the changelog are reconciled accordingly.\n\nSTATUS: success", "turn_key": "sha256:c2386d24cb6513ddc8d5614e61507ecf"}
